UnitRelayLifecycleMaxi
├── given a freshly initialized maxi relay
│   └── it should clone both satellites and pair mint the bootstrap 1:1
├── when the keeper processes a pending deposit
│   └── it should pair mint at the current backing to supply ratio
├── when the principal token fires the hook on a pair mint
│   └── it should return early and leave the settle to the yield token leg
├── when only the first of two pending deposits is admitted
│   └── it should hand back only the admitted weight from the pending counter
├── when the yield token is transferred around a notify
│   └── it should settle seller and buyer at pre-change balances
├── when the yield token moves through an allowance
│   └── it should settle both ends and spend the allowance
├── when a holder settles twice without claiming
│   └── it should add the second accrual on top of the banked one
├── when a holder claims
│   └── it should pay out the settled reward and de-account it
├── when claiming with pending and fresh accrual
│   └── it should pay the carried pending plus the accrual since the last checkpoint
├── when a pair mints to an accruing holder
│   └── it should settle the recipient at the pre-mint balance
├── when registering an exit after selling the yield
│   └── it should revert with InsufficientFreeShares
├── when registering an exit without principal
│   └── it should revert with InsufficientFreeShares
├── when transferring past the escrowed balance
│   └── it should revert with EscrowedSharesLocked
├── when transferring more yield than the balance
│   └── it should revert with InsufficientBalance
├── when draining a fully escrowed holder
│   └── it should release the escrow before the burns so the drain completes
├── when draining only the first of two queued exits
│   └── it should release only the head entry and keep the tail escrowed
├── when draining an accruing exit
│   └── it should settle the accrual at the pre-burn balance
├── when transferring yield to the zero address
│   ├── it should revert with InvalidRecipient for the zero address
│   ├── it should accept the relay, the token itself and the sibling satellite alike
│   └── it should leave the supply and the pair invariant untouched
├── when transferring the principal token
│   └── it should revert on every holder path
├── when minting from outside the relay
│   └── it should revert with NotRelay
├── when burning from outside the relay
│   └── it should revert with NotRelay
├── when initializing a satellite twice
│   └── it should revert with AlreadyInitialized
└── when the hook caller is not a satellite
    └── it should revert with NotAuthorized
